lines:
Umm... If this goes here, and that
goes over there...{be01}
Then where does this thing go?
And what about that doohickey?{be01}
Aaargh! I can’t make heads or tails
of this!

Hm?
Hi, I’m Dock.{be01}
Capt. Stern commissioned me to
design a ferry.{be01}
Oh! That there...
Are they Devon Goods?{be01}
But, hmm...
This won’t do...{be01}
Capt. Stern went off somewhere.
He said he had some work to do.{be01}
Could I get you to go find Capt.
Stern and deliver that to him?

Dock: Shipbuilding is an art.{be01}
A lot of things can’t be figured out
just by calculating.{be01}
I really could use advice from a veteran
who knows the seas...

哈奇：啊，{0100:0}！好久不见！自从我遇见
了你，我这个老水手又焕发青春啦！{be01}
所以我决定来帮津贺造渡轮。毕竟你
看，渡轮上可以载很多人呢。那个津{be01}
贺也真不简单。有他的技术和我的经
验，我敢肯定我们一定能造出一了不{be01}
起的船！
